          "type": "text",
          "title": "Seasonality and launch timing",
          "text": "Apple reports historically higher first-quarter net sales, partly due to holiday demand; launches can affect sales, costs and operating expenses, including sales to indirect distribution channels.",
          "status": "reported",
          "evidence": {
            "source_id": "sec_aapl_10q",
            "quote": "The Company has historically experienced higher net sales in its first quarter compared to other quarters in its fiscal year due in part to seasonal holiday demand. Additionally, new product and service introductions can significantly impact net sales, cost of sales and operating expenses."
